{"2480100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dino Ramen Express", "steam_appid": 2480100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/37b783c043400655addc62e0e4bd3501.avif?t=1772971907\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras_big/37b783c043400655addc62e0e4bd3501.webp?t=1772971907 width=1560 height=662 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/f385b40b0c16814c3e6b116a39aeb431.poster.avif?t=1772971907\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/f385b40b0c16814c3e6b116a39aeb431.webm?t=1772971907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/f385b40b0c16814c3e6b116a39aeb431.mp4?t=1772971907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience this “History” from Earth, 2102 AD! As an already invincible you, you and your best friend will build the legendary Ramen Dino on a deserted island! Gather ingredients and hire employees in wild, unconventional ways. Run your shop quietly and lawfully… or seize resources through intense, unprecedented battles! Amid countless open-world adventures, uncover the truth behind “human extinction.” Reconnect the divided people of this isolated island with takeout and delicious food! As the mysterious rabbit-man Alicell, you will save the ARKPARK once again!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/88adf226b87813db4bcda47a8b449a56.poster.avif?t=1772971907\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/88adf226b87813db4bcda47a8b449a56.webm?t=1772971907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/88adf226b87813db4bcda47a8b449a56.mp4?t=1772971907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/48aafd5bf8780aaab9506df05a432ca3.poster.avif?t=1772971907\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/48aafd5bf8780aaab9506df05a432ca3.webm?t=1772971907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/48aafd5bf8780aaab9506df05a432ca3.mp4?t=1772971907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre creatures (robots), cute and mischievous BBs, invaders from outer space… and you, who just wants to run a ramen shop! Treasure hidden under coconut trees? Collecting all kinds of ingredients? Ships that sink immediately? The owner of the mysterious device? The “Island Master” pulling all the strings behind the scenes? And your amazing friends!!! Nothing can stop you from continuing your story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/4f740e0a56334aeaab6c7a38331a50b1.poster.avif?t=1772971907\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/4f740e0a56334aeaab6c7a38331a50b1.webm?t=1772971907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/4f740e0a56334aeaab6c7a38331a50b1.mp4?t=1772971907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are already invincible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except for seawater!!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an invincible cosmic life form — ALICELL — your greatest enemies are those who try to push you into the water… and… everyone weaker than you…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“With this invincible power… will you save, destroy… or just open a ramen shop? Wani!!!”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/a2cd800c4133c028693e77096604d209.poster.avif?t=1772971907\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/a2cd800c4133c028693e77096604d209.webm?t=1772971907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/a2cd800c4133c028693e77096604d209.mp4?t=1772971907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer adventures with friends in the big open world!!! All ALICELLs are split from the original body! Jump on their heads to become a mobile turret! Fight together, eat together, run under the sunset together, dominate everyone together… or… make them hand over their loot!!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Do you really expect a great hero who saved the World Island to unclog a toilet???”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Gimme that!!!”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/6afd3bd45a45a182cb5cbfa3ce4536a1.poster.avif?t=1772971907\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/6afd3bd45a45a182cb5cbfa3ce4536a1.webm?t=1772971907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480100/extras/6afd3bd45a45a182cb5cbfa3ce4536a1.mp4?t=1772971907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This blue planet once bore four civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fifth is now nearing its end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just an interlude before the final judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the long years make you forget?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You once got knocked into the sea by Orange Kid…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why won’t anyone come to the ramen shop?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not enough wood for building!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m reporting the game devs!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown regions…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sealed high cities…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world drifting further apart…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All are the price of this beautiful paradise…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can “Destiny” be anti?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are just an alien,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a mass of “Astral Essence” that happened to gain self-awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your friends never see you that way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The master of ArkPARK awaits your answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" 